<title>USA: NationsBank sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>NationsBank sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp said Wednesday its board of directors today approved a two-for-one split of NationsBank common stock.</p>
<p>The distribution is payable February 27 shareholders of record February 7.</p>
<p>&quot;This stock split underscores the board's confidence that our strong performance will continue,&quot; said Chief Executive Officer Hugh L. McColl Jr.</p>
</text>
